                "Incorporate the Japanese practice of Ringisho\u2014the circulation of a draft document for pre-signing. In software engineering, share your draft Google Doc or GitHub PR with two or three trusted peers for asynchronous redlining before sharing it with management. When peers see their suggestions incorporated in real-time, they transition from passive spectators into proud co-authors who have an emotional stake in defending the proposal.",
